# Everything the image must never contain, or that would bust the build cache.
#
# `.env` first and deliberately: a secret baked into an image layer survives deletion
# of the file and travels wherever the image goes.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
.claude
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.storage
docker/volumes
coverage
